description:
Two redheads giving fiery opinions on dating, relationships, life, pop culture, and everything people are afraid to say out loud. Expect hilarious stories, hot takes, unfiltered debates, playful roasting, and plenty of “Did she really just say that?” moments. No topic is too hot, no opinion is off limits, and you never know what we’ll say next. 🤫🔥🎙️👩🏼‍🦰😏
Follow us on IG & TikTok or watch on YouTube:
@redhotunfiltered
